  "text": "Home\nAbout\nProducts\nIoT\nServices\nCareer\nContact\nHead of Business Development\n Application Deadline: December 18, 2025\nHead of Business Development (Full Time)\n Application Deadline: December 18, 2025\nResponsibilities\nLead, plan, and execute business development strategies across software, IoT, AI, communication platforms, and hardware solutions.\nIdentify new business opportunities, markets, and potential corporate/government clients.\nBuild and manage a high-performing Business Development & Sales team.\nEstablish and maintain strong relationships with clients, partners, and vendors (software + hardware).\nDrive sales for product lines including servers, network devices, firewalls, call center solutions, and enterprise software.\nOversee RFP/RFQ processes, tender documentation, and proposal development.\nCollaborate with technical and product teams to create market-fit solutions.\nConduct market research, competitor analysis, and strategic forecasting.\nRepresent Suffix IT Limited at events, exhibitions, seminars, and conferences.\nRequirements\nEducational background in Business Administration, Computer Science, Engineering, or related fields (MBA preferred).\nMinimum 10+ years of experience in the IT industry with proven leadership in Business Development, Sales, or Strategic Growth roles.\nStrong understanding of:\nSoftware products & SaaS solutions\nIoT platforms & industrial automation\nAI/ML applications\nCall center & communication solutions\nServers, networking devices, firewalls & enterprise hardware\nProven track record of achieving sales targets and building client relationships.\nExcellent communication, negotiation, and presentation skills.\nAbility to lead and motivate multi-functional teams.\nStrong network within corporate, government, and enterprise sectors.\nWhat We Offer\nAttractive salary and performance-based incentives\nLeadership role with strategic decision-making authority\nOpportunity to work across software + hardware business lines\nFast-paced, innovation-driven work environment\nLong-term career growth with national and international exposure\nJob Information\nJob Type\nFull Time\nCategory\nBusiness Development\nLocation\nUttar Badda,Dhaka\nOffered Salary\nNegotiable\nFestival Bonus\n2\nExperience\n10+ Years in IT Industry\nGender\nMale/Female (both)\nEmail\ncareer@suffixit.com\nApplication Ends\nDecember 18, 2025\nAPPLY\n\nWe maintain strategic partnerships with multiple organizations in Bangladesh and worldwide, working together to deliver high-quality solutions and long-term value.\n\nCONTACT US\n\nCha-70,70/A, Rupayan Millennium Square (9A), Progoti Sharoni, North Badda, Gulshan, Dhaka-1212.\n\ninfo@suffixit.com\n\n+88 01958 424000\n\nQUICK LINKS\nAbout Us\nCareer\nContact Us\n\n© 2026 All Rights Reserved by Suffix IT Limited",
